AltoBaseMarket::AddCollateral()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── when market is frozen
│   └── it should revert
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when assets is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when onBehalf is zero address
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when user has insufficient balance
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when user has sufficient balance
        ├── it should add collateral to position
        ├── it should transfer collateral tokens from sender
        ├── it should emit AddCollateral event
        └── it should return the amount of assets added